5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! Let's all work together to find the werewolf and keep our village safe!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,...Hello.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's keep this logical. We need to observe everyone's behavior carefully to identify any contradictions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to see you all. Let us be kind to one another, even in these worrying times.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shizue-san. Let's try to maintain harmony while we figure this out.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,Does anyone have any initial thoughts or strategies they want to share?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't really know.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Not yet. It's too early for patterns. I'll be watching for anyone who seems overly eager to deflect suspicion.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"My, you are very thorough, Asuka-san. I'm sure your logic will help us.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I'll just listen for now and see if I notice anything unusual.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
