31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Everyone, I have some very important information. I am the Seer, and I checked Asuka-san... she is the werewolf!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,...What? Really?,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,That is a bold lie. I am a villager. Yumi is claiming to be the Seer to frame me immediately.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh my, what a shocking start to the day. Are you sure, Yumi-chan?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"This is sudden. Yumi-chan, are you certain about your divination?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm absolutely sure! I saw it clearly. We have to vote for Asuka-san today!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,If Yumi is telling the truth... then we should...,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Think logically. If I were the werewolf, would I be this obvious? Yumi is likely the werewolf or the possessed trying to eliminate a threat.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It is hard to know who to trust. But Yumi-chan seems so sincere.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"It is a difficult choice. Asuka-san's logic is sound, but Yumi-chan's claim is very direct.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm not lying! Please, believe me! If we don't vote for her now, she'll just kill more of us!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,@Asuka... why would Yumi-san lie about this?,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Because the werewolf needs to create a fake Seer to control the narrative. I am being framed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"I feel a bit sad that we must suspect each other, but we must protect the village.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm leaning toward believing Yumi-chan. It's a big risk to claim Seer if you aren't.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Please, everyone! Let's vote for Asuka-san!","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll trust Yumi-san.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"This is an emotional decision, not a logical one. You are making a mistake.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I will trust our dear Yumi-chan. I'm sorry, Asuka-san.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's go with Yumi-chan's information.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
